# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Incremental adoption.
#
# Prettier was added after these files were written. Reformatting them in one pass
# would produce a diff across every source file in the project — 2500 lines of CSS
# among them — which would be unreviewable and would hide any real change inside it.
# So they are exempt for now and `npm run format:check` stays green.
#
# To adopt a file: delete its line here, run `npm run format`, and commit that
# reformat ON ITS OWN with no logic change in the same commit. One file per commit
# keeps every diff readable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
